<title>USA: Providian sets new spin-off record date.</title>
<headline>Providian sets new spin-off record date.</headline>
<dateline>LOUSVILLE, Ky. 1997-06-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Providian Corp said on Friday it set a new record date of June 10 to determine shareholders eligible to receive the spin-off dividend of its wholly owned subsidiary, Providian Bancorp Inc.</p>
<p>Providian also said in a news release that its annual meeting was adjourned on Thursday and will reconvene June 6. At the meeting, shareholders will vote on the merger of its insurance operations with the U.S. insurance operations of Aegon NV.</p>
<p>Providian is a financial services company.</p>
</text>
